OL,3,GNEWSAMarra and Fagan to contest
OL,4,AScottish Labour leadership
OL,5,
OL,6,FMichael Marra and Joe Fagan will
OL,7,Fcontest the Scottish Labour leadership
OL,8,Fafter Monica Lennon failed to secure
OL,9,Fenough nominations to enter the race.
OL,11,FAnas Sarwar triggered the contest last
OL,12,Fmonth after he announced his intention
OL,13,Fto stand down as both Scottish leader
OL,14,Fand MSP to join Andy Burnham's
OL,15,Fgovernment.
OL,17,FSarwar's decision came after Labour
OL,18,Ffinished joint second in May's Holyrood
OL,19,Felection, tied with Reform on 17 seats
OL,20,Feach.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
